{"title":"Conference Report and Intelligence Briefing: ACE2024","link":"https://iafor.org/conference-report-and-intelligence-briefing-ace2024/","date":1739769135000,"content":"<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/ACE2025-Conference-Report-1500-21-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"ACE2024 Conference Report, Tokyo\" srcset=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/ACE2025-Conference-Report-1500-21-150x150.jpg 150w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/ACE2025-Conference-Report-1500-21-600x600.jpg 600w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/ACE2025-Conference-Report-1500-21-100x100.jpg 100w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/ACE2025-Conference-Report-1500-21-50x50.jpg 50w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/ACE2025-Conference-Report-1500-21-300x300.jpg 300w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/ACE2025-Conference-Report-1500-21-32x32.jpg 32w\" />The 16th Asian Conference on Education (ACE2024) took place in Tokyo, Japan from November 25-29, 2024 and attracted a total of 710 people from 47 countries. A key theme that emerged during the conference was ‘community’, a theme that links well with IAFOR’s four designated Conference Themes for 2025-2029 programming.\n<p><a href=\"https://iafor.org/conference-report-and-intelligence-briefing-ace2024/\">Source</a></p>","author":"IAFOR","siteTitle":"The International Academic Forum (IAFOR)","siteHash":"db6175d8277e1d8dd86d5cc607b1dd9335cce255aa7e00b46d0931f23a0d47f6","entryHash":"49fff15189a184981f034ea97994646bcf4e779b5a3f734bbaf7607f7e8fe9db","category":"Interdisciplinary"}